sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant P as 飞书平台
    participant C as FeishuChannel
    participant B as BaseChannel
    participant M as ChannelManager
    Note over C,B: 回复：来自本轮处理结果
    B->>B: reply_text，获取一次限流额度
    B->>C: _send_text(subject, text)
    C->>C: 按 subject.metadata 选择路由
    C->>P: 调用发送 API
    P-->>U: 显示回答
    B->>B: 清理辅助任务，成功后更新上下文
    Note over P,M: 推送：使用调用方已有内容
    M->>C: push_text(subject, text)
    C->>C: 解析主动路由，获取额度
    C->>C: _send_text(subject, text)
    C->>P: 调用发送 API
    P-->>U: 显示主动消息
